Subject: [PATCH v2 2/3] clk: renesas: Use bitfield helpers
Date: Fri, 31 Jan 2025 14:46:52 +0100
Message-ID: <a407704e1efc9239e8b65cc66b16efbcb8ea8882.1738329459.git.geert+renesas@glider.be>
